        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beaver TD</i> is a tower defense game with <strong>roguelite</strong> elements, where you <strong>build wooden rafts to shape the enemy’s path</strong>. Summon <strong>heroic beavers</strong> onto these floating battle stations—each with unique abilities and personalities—to defend your base from chaotic waves of mutated monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/8a28b6c00a31f428218027c69248db3b.avif?t=1785480916\" alt=\"Header image and Game logo\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Rafts – Redirect Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no preset paths. Control where enemies go by strategically placing rafts and blocking their routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.poster.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.webm?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.mp4?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Beaver Warriors – Flexible Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot arrows, stun, slow, break armor… Every beaver has a distinct role. Get creative with your tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/14dee19aa6285743dc0f223aec347511.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources &amp; Radiation Cores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radioactive cores and monster drops to craft gear, upgrade your base, and unlock new beaver units.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/aa0632628b24a7fbc9a84d50f0249374.poster.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/aa0632628b24a7fbc9a84d50f0249374.webm?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base Upgrades &amp; Skill Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more enemies you defeat, the faster you level up—unlock special skills like damage boosts, attack speed, critical hits, healing, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/1cd3d1db618ae5946a2f211c562330a0.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Gameplay – A New Experience Every Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps, randomized summons, and permanent death. But each run lets you keep resources to grow stronger over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/74b48c0b67556786564d19185b5a1f05.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-peaceful lake has turned into ground zero for radioactive chaos. Lead a fearless beaver resistance and protect every raft, every drop of water—because you are nature’s last hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOPMENT STATUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaver TD is currently in development by a solo indie developer. Your feedback is incredibly valuable in shaping the game’s final form!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/c411281ead140a63578603eeb24e74d8.poster.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/c411281ead140a63578603eeb24e74d8.webm?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beaver TD</i> is a tower defense game with <strong>roguelite</strong> elements, where you <strong>build wooden rafts to shape the enemy’s path</strong>. Summon <strong>heroic beavers</strong> onto these floating battle stations—each with unique abilities and personalities—to defend your base from chaotic waves of mutated monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/8a28b6c00a31f428218027c69248db3b.avif?t=1785480916\" alt=\"Header image and Game logo\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Rafts – Redirect Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no preset paths. Control where enemies go by strategically placing rafts and blocking their routes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.poster.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.webm?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/78a16993c13572ad92fd5e518068b0ab.mp4?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summon Beaver Warriors – Flexible Defense</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot arrows, stun, slow, break armor… Every beaver has a distinct role. Get creative with your tactics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/14dee19aa6285743dc0f223aec347511.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=334 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather Resources &amp; Radiation Cores</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use radioactive cores and monster drops to craft gear, upgrade your base, and unlock new beaver units.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/aa0632628b24a7fbc9a84d50f0249374.poster.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/aa0632628b24a7fbc9a84d50f0249374.webm?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Base Upgrades &amp; Skill Unlocks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more enemies you defeat, the faster you level up—unlock special skills like damage boosts, attack speed, critical hits, healing, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/1cd3d1db618ae5946a2f211c562330a0.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=186 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelite Gameplay – A New Experience Every Run</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated maps, randomized summons, and permanent death. But each run lets you keep resources to grow stronger over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/74b48c0b67556786564d19185b5a1f05.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=184 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A once-peaceful lake has turned into ground zero for radioactive chaos. Lead a fearless beaver resistance and protect every raft, every drop of water—because you are nature’s last hope.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEVELOPMENT STATUS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beaver TD is currently in development by a solo indie developer. Your feedback is incredibly valuable in shaping the game’s final form!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/c411281ead140a63578603eeb24e74d8.poster.avif?t=1785480916\" width=616 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3875260/extras/c411281ead140a63578603eeb24e74d8.webm?t=1785480916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
        "short_description": "A tower defense game with roguelite elements, where you build wooden rafts, summon beaver warriors, and strategically control enemy paths to lead them into traps. Gather resources, upgrade your base, unlock powerful skills, and adapt to chaotic enemy waves to survive as long as possible!",
